{%- comment -%}
  Outputs "true" when the product offers a free scented sample.
  Accepts:
  - product: {Object}

  A product offers a sample when any of these are true:
  - metafield custom.free_sample is true
  - tagged "sample" or "free-sample"
  - tagged "fragrance"
  - handle is "a-woman-remembered"
  - product type reads parfum / perfume / fragrance / cologne / scent

  It is withheld when the metafield is explicitly false, when the product is
  tagged "no-sample", or when samples are switched off in theme settings.

  The sample is deliberately not gated on edition_state. While the doors are
  shut the scented card is the only way to meet the perfume at all, which is
  exactly when it is worth sending.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign sample = false

  if product != blank and settings.samples_enabled
    assign sample_meta = product.metafields.custom.free_sample.value
    assign tag_list = product.tags | join: ',' | downcase
    assign type_handle = product.type | handle

    if sample_meta == true or sample_meta == 'true'
      assign sample = true
    elsif tag_list contains 'sample'
      assign sample = true
    elsif tag_list contains 'fragrance'
      assign sample = true
    elsif product.handle == 'a-woman-remembered'
      assign sample = true
    elsif type_handle contains 'parfum' or type_handle contains 'perfume'
      assign sample = true
    elsif type_handle contains 'fragrance' or type_handle contains 'cologne' or type_handle contains 'scent'
      assign sample = true
    endif

    if sample_meta == false or sample_meta == 'false' or tag_list contains 'no-sample'
      assign sample = false
    endif
  endif
-%}
{%- if sample -%}true{%- endif -%}
